message: >
  If FS2.jl or its computational data contributes to your research, please
  cite the paper listed in the preferred citation below. The Zenodo DOI
  identifies the archived software and computational data release.

title: "FS2.jl: Character fields generated by a single value"
abstract: >-
  Julia/OSCAR code and computational data for investigations of whether the
  field of values of an irreducible character is generated by a single
  character value.
type: software

